  "howToPlay": {
    "json": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "How to Play",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Lotto America\u00ae jackpots start at $2 million. ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "value": "There are 9 ways to win",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " and if you purchase the Lotto America All Star Bonus\u00ae, you could win $100,000 without even hitting the jackpot.\u00a0 ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "You can purchase Lotto America tickets online any time by selecting the Buy Now button and adding tickets to your shopping cart. When making your purchase online, you can select Quick Pick to have numbers automatically selected for you, choose Create My Own Ticket to select your own lucky numbers, play Same As Last Time to recreate your last ticket, or select Subscribe so you never miss a draw.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "To purchase tickets at retail, ask the store clerk for a Quick Pick (QP) ticket or fill out a play slip. Each play slip has five boards.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "Ask the store clerk for a Quick Pick (QP) ticket or fill out a play slip. Each play slip has five boards. Each board costs $1. Each board contains two sets of numbers: one set from 1 through 52 and the second set from 1 through 10.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "To play a board, pick five numbers from the set of 52 numbers, then pick one number (the Star Ball\u00ae) from the set of 10 numbers. Fill in the circles for the numbers you wish to play. Do not use red ink and do not erase. If you make an error, mark the VOID circle, and then make selections on another board.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "You may purchase the same boards for up to 15 consecutive draws on one single ticket when you check the appropriate number of draws in the multi-draw box.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "You may select QP and have the computer randomly pick the numbers for you. Either mark the QP option on the play slip for up to five boards and your desired multi-draw option or ask the store clerk for a QP ticket for up to 10 boards and your desired multi-draw option.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "To multiply any prize won by 2X, 3X, 4X, or 5X* (except the jackpot), mark the All Star Bonus\u00ae circle or tell the clerk you want the All Star Bonus\u00ae option. This will add an additional $1 to the total cost of your wager on all boards played.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [],
                      "value": "Tickets cannot be cancelled after issued. You are responsible for the selection of your numbers and options, not the retailer or the Lottery.\u00a0",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "list-item"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "unordered-list"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "*The jackpot prize is not included in the All Star Bonus\u00ae multiplier option.\u00a0 ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
